Design observations that can test a ground model and inform a response (@mine-ground-monitoring: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP", #source "../sources/NIOSH-Stone-Mine-Pillars-and-Roof-Spans.lingua#r_5PSV3N7QTFG43D1GDG8BWEYW08", #source "../sources/NR-22-Mineracao.lingua#r_2MFMFMPEV36SZGMYM8YAZYEQHK", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "../equipment/Excavation-as-material-transformation-and-system-work.lingua#r_356XP73S1SACTRRWKTF933G7AS") { r_031R2XG88PEQPGZH6A41J50TY4
**Read:** [Practical Rock Engineering — Evert Hoek](../sources/Practical-Rock-Engineering-Hoek.lingua#r_5VDNJTZ30N76R8Y5DP3T212SGP), the complete design-acceptance, case, and response-monitoring discussions; [Pillar and Roof Span Design Guidelines for Underground Stone Mines — NIOSH](../sources/NIOSH-Stone-Mine-Pillars-and-Roof-Spans.lingua#r_5PSV3N7QTFG43D1GDG8BWEYW08), the full applicable observation/method limitations; [NR-22 — Segurança e Saúde Ocupacional na Mineração](../sources/NR-22-Mineracao.lingua#r_2MFMFMPEV36SZGMYM8YAZYEQHK), the complete applicable current monitoring/responsibility context.

Monitoring connects a proposed mechanism, measurable quantity, instrument/inspection method, spatial/time support, uncertainty, communication, and an identified decision. Ground displacement, strain, stress, water pressure, seismicity, and visible damage observe different aspects and may not change together.

Instrument location, calibration, installation, reference stability, drift, sampling interval, communications, power, missing data, and actual availability affect interpretation. A precise reading at one point does not establish the state of every unobserved feature or the validity of a model outside its domain.

Compare predictions and observations with uncertainty, alternative mechanisms, and changes in work/conditions recorded. A threshold needs a justified relationship with performance and a response process; copying a value from another case does not create that evidence. Preserve who receives information and how revised assumptions affect work.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete ground-monitoring case from model and measurement design through observed response and revision. Independently check a measurement or model comparison, examine a missing/faulty-instrument scenario, and propose an observation capable of distinguishing the main alternative mechanism.

Read full observational/design-acceptance and relevant current operating guidance. The next extraction/equipment sequence uses the ground basis as an active constraint rather than a report completed once before production.

**Continue:** [Connect excavation with material properties, ground, fragmentation, and downstream work](../equipment/Excavation-as-material-transformation-and-system-work.lingua#r_356XP73S1SACTRRWKTF933G7AS).

**Return:** [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](../Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA).
